#: src/menus/windows.xml:19(title) src/menus/tools.xml:19(title)
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Visão geral"

#: src/menus/windows.xml:20(para)
msgid ""
"In this section, you will find help for commands in the "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Windows</guimenu></menuchoice> menu, which allows you "
"to manage <acronym>GIMP</acronym>'s windows and docks."
msgstr ""
"Nesta seção você encontra ajuda para os comandos do menu "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Janelas</guimenu></menuchoice>, que permite gerenciar "
"as janelas e encaixes do <acronym>GIMP</acronym>."

#: src/menus/windows.xml:26(para)
msgid ""
"The available commands of this menu may vary according presence or absence "
"of images and docks."
msgstr ""
"Os comandos disponíveis neste menu podem variar conforme a presença ou "
"ausência de imagens e encaixes."

#: src/menus/windows.xml:33(title)
#| msgid "Contents of the <quote>Windows</quote> Menu"
msgid "The Contents of the <quote>Windows</quote> Menu"
msgstr "Conteúdos do menu <quote>Janelas</quote>"

#: src/menus/windows.xml:36(term)
#| msgid "Recently closed"
msgid "Recently Closed Docks"
msgstr "Encaixes fechados recentemente"

#: src/menus/windows.xml:38(para)
#: src/menus/windows-open-recent-docks.xml:16(para)
msgid ""
"This command opens the list of the docks you have closed recently. You can "
"reopen them by clicking on their name. Please note that isolated windows are"
" not concerned."
msgstr ""
"Este comando abre a lista de diálogos de encaixe que você fechou "
"recentemente. Você pode reabri-los ao clicar nos seus nomes. Por favor "
"perceba que janelas isoladas não são levadas em conta."

#: src/menus/windows.xml:43(para)
msgid ""
"For more information about docks, please see <link linkend=\"gimp-concepts-"
"docks\">Dialogs and Docking</link>."
msgstr ""
"Para mais informação sobre diálogos encaixáveis, por favor veja <link "
"linkend=\"gimp-concepts-docks\">Diálogos e Encaixes</link>."

#: src/menus/windows.xml:50(term)
#| msgid "A dockable dialog."
msgid "Dockable Dialogs"
msgstr "Um diálogo de encaixe."

#: src/menus/windows.xml:52(para)
#| msgid ""
#| "<command>Dockable Dialogs</command>: this command opens the list of dockable"
#| " dialogs. Please refer to <xref linkend=\"gimp-concepts-docks\"/>."
msgid ""
"This command opens the list of dockable dialogs. Please refer to <xref "
"linkend=\"gimp-concepts-docks\"/>."
msgstr ""
"Este comando abre a lista de diálogos encaixáveis. Consulte <xref "
"linkend=\"gimp-concepts-docks\"/>."

#: src/menus/windows.xml:60(term)
#| msgid "Tools"
msgid "Toolbox"
msgstr "Caixa de ferramentas"

#: src/menus/windows.xml:62(para)
#| msgid ""
#| "<command>Toolbox</command>: clicking on this command or using the "
#| "<keycombo><keycap>Ctrl</keycap><keycap>B</keycap></keycombo> shortcut, "
#| "raises the toolbox usually together with the tool options dock. Note that in"
#| " single-window mode this usually doesn't have any effect since the toolbox "
#| "is part of the main window."
msgid ""
"Clicking on this command or using the "
"<keycombo><keycap>Ctrl</keycap><keycap>B</keycap></keycombo> shortcut, "
"raises the toolbox usually together with the tool options dock."
msgstr ""
"Clicar neste comando ou usar o atalho "
"<keycombo><keycap>Ctrl</keycap><keycap>B</keycap></keycombo> traz a caixa de"
" ferramentas para a frente, geralmente junto com o encaixe de opções da "
"ferramenta."

#: src/menus/windows.xml:70(para)
msgid ""
"Note that in single-window mode this usually doesn't have any effect since "
"the toolbox is part of the main window."
msgstr ""
"Note que, no modo de janela única, isto normalmente não tem efeito, já que a"
" caixa de ferramentas faz parte da janela principal."

#: src/menus/windows.xml:78(term)
#| msgid "Without open images"
msgid "The list of open image windows"
msgstr "A lista de janelas de imagem abertas"

#: src/menus/windows.xml:80(para)
#| msgid ""
#| "The list of open image windows: clicking on an image name, or using the "
#| "<keycombo><keycap>Alt</keycap><keycap>Number of the "
#| "image</keycap></keycombo> shortcut, makes the image active."
msgid ""
"Clicking on an image name, or using the "
"<keycombo><keycap>Alt</keycap><keycap>Number of the "
"image</keycap></keycombo> shortcut, makes the image active."
msgstr ""
"A lista de janelas de imagens abertas: clicar no nome de uma imagem, ou usar"
" o atalho <keycombo><keycap>Alt</keycap><keycap>Número da "
"imagem</keycap></keycombo>, torna a imagem ativa."

#: src/menus/windows.xml:90(term)
msgid "The list of open docks"
msgstr "A lista de encaixes abertos"

#: src/menus/windows.xml:92(para)
#| msgid ""
#| "The list of open docks: in this list, docks are named with the name of the "
#| "active dialog in this dock. Clicking on a dock name raises this dock. Note "
#| "that in single-window mode only docks that are not part of the main window "
#| "will be shown here."
msgid ""
"In this list, docks are named with the name of the active dialog in this "
"dock. Clicking on a dock name raises this dock. Note that in single-window "
"mode only docks that are not part of the main window will be shown here."
msgstr ""
"Nesta lista, os encaixes recebem o nome do diálogo ativo neles. Clicar no "
"nome de um encaixe o traz para a frente. Note que, no modo de janela única, "
"só serão mostrados aqui os encaixes que não fazem parte da janela principal."

#: src/menus/windows.xml:101(term)
#| msgid "Docks"
msgid "Hide Docks"
msgstr "Ocultar encaixes"

#: src/menus/windows.xml:103(para)
#| msgid ""
#| "<command>Hide Docks</command> (<keycap>Tab</keycap>): this command hides all"
#| " docks (usually to the left and right of the image), leaving the image "
#| "window alone. The command status is kept on quitting GIMP and will be in the"
#| " same state when GIMP starts."
msgid ""
"Clicking on this command or using the (<keycap>Tab</keycap>) shortcut hides "
"all docks (usually to the left and right of the image), leaving the image "
"window alone. The command status is kept on quitting <acronym>GIMP</acronym>"
" and will be in the same state when <acronym>GIMP</acronym> starts."
msgstr ""
"Clicar neste comando ou usar o atalho (<keycap>Tab</keycap>) oculta todos os"
" encaixes (geralmente à esquerda e à direita da imagem), deixando apenas a "
"janela de imagem. O estado do comando é mantido ao sair do "
"<acronym>GIMP</acronym> e estará no mesmo estado quando o "
"<acronym>GIMP</acronym> iniciar."

#: src/menus/windows.xml:113(term)
msgid "Show Tabs"
msgstr "Mostrar abas"

#: src/menus/windows.xml:115(para)
#| msgid ""
#| "<command>Show Tabs</command>: in single-window mode this command changes "
#| "whether or not to show the tabs with all opened images. By default the tab "
#| "bar is shown, but you can hide it if you don't need it and want to use the "
#| "extra screen space."
msgid ""
"In single-window mode this command changes whether or not to show the tabs "
"with all opened images. By default the tab bar is shown, but you can hide it"
" if you don't need it and want to use the extra screen space."
msgstr ""
"No modo de janela única, este comando define se as abas com todas as imagens"
" abertas serão mostradas ou não. Por padrão a barra de abas é mostrada, mas "
"você pode ocultá-la se não precisar dela e quiser usar o espaço extra da "
"tela."

#: src/menus/windows.xml:121(para) src/menus/windows.xml:137(para)
msgid "In multi-window mode this command is disabled."
msgstr "No modo de janelas múltiplas, este comando é desabilitado."

#: src/menus/windows.xml:127(term)
msgid "Tabs Position"
msgstr "Posição das abas"

#: src/menus/windows.xml:129(para)
#| msgid ""
#| "<command>Tabs Position</command>: In single-window mode you can use this "
#| "command to choose the position of the tab bar that shows the loaded images. "
#| "By default the tab bar is located at the <guilabel>Top</guilabel>, but you "
#| "can change this to show it at the <guilabel>Bottom</guilabel>, "
#| "<guilabel>Left</guilabel>, or <guilabel>Right</guilabel>."
msgid ""
"In single-window mode you can use this command to choose the position of the"
" tab bar that shows the loaded images. By default the tab bar is located at "
"the <guilabel>Top</guilabel>, but you can change this to show it at the "
"<guilabel>Bottom</guilabel>, <guilabel>Left</guilabel>, or "
"<guilabel>Right</guilabel>."
msgstr ""
"No modo de janela única, você pode usar este comando para escolher a posição"
" da barra de abas que mostra as imagens carregadas. Por padrão a barra de "
"abas fica em <guilabel>Superior</guilabel>, mas você pode mudar para exibi-"
"la em <guilabel>Inferior</guilabel>, <guilabel>Esquerda</guilabel> ou "
"<guilabel>Direita</guilabel>."

#: src/menus/windows.xml:143(term)
msgid "Single Window Mode"
msgstr "Modo de janela única"

#: src/menus/windows.xml:145(para)
#| msgid ""
#| "<command>Single Window Mode</command>: when enabled, GIMP is in a single "
#| "window mode. Please see <xref linkend=\"single-window-mode\"/>."
msgid ""
"When enabled, <acronym>GIMP</acronym> is in a single window mode. Please see"
" <xref linkend=\"single-window-mode\"/>."
msgstr ""
"Quando habilitado, o <acronym>GIMP</acronym> fica no modo de janela única. "
"Consulte <xref linkend=\"single-window-mode\"/>."

#: src/menus/windows-open-recent-docks.xml:9(title)
msgid "The <quote>Recently Closed Docks</quote> submenu"
msgstr "O submenu de <quote>Diálogos de Encaixe Recentemente Fechados</quote>"

#: src/menus/windows-open-recent-docks.xml:12(primary)
msgid "Docks"
msgstr "Encaixes"

#: src/menus/windows-open-recent-docks.xml:13(secondary)
msgid "Recently closed"
msgstr "Recentemente fechados"

#: src/menus/windows-open-recent-docks.xml:23(title)
msgid "Activating the Command"
msgstr "Ativando o comando"

#: src/menus/windows-open-recent-docks.xml:25(para)
#| msgid ""
#| "You can access this command from the image menubar through "
#| "<menuchoice><guimenu>Windows</guimenu><guimenuitem>Recently Closed "
#| "Docks</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgid ""
"You can access this command from the main menu through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Windows</guimenu><guimenuitem>Recently Closed "
"Docks</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Você pode acessar esse comando através da barra de menus da imagem em "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Janelas</guimenu><guimenuitem>Diálogos de encaixe "
"Recentemente Fechados</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

